query: MATCH (n:Person) OPTIONAL MATCH (n)-[:KNOWS]->(m) WHERE m.age > 30 RETURN n, m
diagnostics: 1
  W6016: WHERE constrains the OPTIONAL MATCH binding `m` — this discards unmatched rows, defeating OPTIONAL
    note: move the predicate into the OPTIONAL MATCH (`OPTIONAL MATCH (...) WHERE ...`) to keep unmatched rows, or drop OPTIONAL if a strict MATCH was intended
